  "headline": "Atenolol is not on FDA's shortage list; supply at Corvale East is 6.4 days and a transfer from Corvale Lakeside is the top option",
  "headline_cites": ["D4", "D1", "D5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include atenolol as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 105 tablets of atenolol 25 mg with a daily use of 16.5, giving 6.4 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 80 tablets of atenolol 25 mg with a daily use of 3.2, giving 25.1 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule‑ranked option 1 is to transfer 35 tablets of 25 mg from Corvale Lakeside to Corvale East, which would leave Lakeside with 14 days and bring East to 8 days.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "All three Corvale sites receive atenolol 25 mg tablets labeled by Bryant Ranch Prepack (NDC 71335153501).",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2", "E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bryant Ranch Prepack's plant (FEI 1000519407) was last inspected on 2026-07-16 and classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E13", "E15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An earlier inspection in 2009 resulted in an OAI classification and a Warning Letter in 2010, but the most recent inspection is VAI.",
      "cites": ["E5", "E14", "E13"]
    }
  ]
}
